VRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"1 out of 5\" title=\"1 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-60px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">1<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">05/26/2026<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2026-05-26\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReview426684837_m3xism3bcnzac5xyznu4liod9_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Real excited the 1st time to use it<br />Start the first day<br />👍 Great 👍 <br />2nd %26 3rd couldn't start it<\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">I only used the brush for about 2 hours<\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Never used<br />The<br />Trimmer<br />Pole saw <br />Hedge trimmer <\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">It wouldn't start again<\/span>\