rop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2024-07-03\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText348999792_amrnx7tj4du9hikn1vo31tgo7_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">Take my advice, go ahead and pay the added couple hundred dollars, and get one of the big brands that make an exchangable trimmer like this. The wild badger brand is garbage. It started within the first 4 to 6 pulls until i had it for about 4 months,<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText348999792_amrnx7tj4du9hikn1vo31tgo7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview348999792_tvc71go1150u18qck1nzj37hp_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview348999792_tvc71go1150u18qck1nzj37hp_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Take my advice, go ahead and pay the added couple hundred dollars, and get one of the big brands that make an exchangable trimmer like this. The wild badger brand is garbage. It started within the first 4 to 6 pulls until i had it for about 4 months, where now if you can actually get it to start it doesn't run very long and thats if you even consider the spitting and sputtering it does running. Absolute waste of money, and of course, there's no one to actually pin down to get a solution for me. Buyers beware<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText348999792_amrnx7tj4du9hikn1vo31tgo7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview348999792_tvc71go1150u18qck1nzj37hp_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVZero BVDI_FVLevel1\"><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">0<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/838770895/review/348999792/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F838770895%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionparams=__BVSUBMISSIONPARAMETERS__&amp;submissionurl=__BVSUBMISSIONURL__&amp;user=__USERID__\" data-bvcfg=\"__CONFIGKEY__\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_AddPositiveFee