s=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"4 out of 5\" title=\"4 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-15px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">4<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">I'd buy another<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">09/12/2020<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2020-09-12\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText237879256_6g7i8hivta7vzel8q6q6kvfup_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">I like my badger wverything came on time just as it was supposed to and its done me a real good job i have run 5 gallons of gas through it and the only problem ive had is the gaurd came off from around the trimmer attachment which i dont mind at all!<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText237879256_6g7i8hivta7vzel8q6q6kvfup_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview237879256_tzwbs8zvo84iw7csoy01cp5b9_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview237879256_tzwbs8zvo84iw7csoy01cp5b9_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">I like my badger wverything came on time just as it was supposed to and its done me a real good job i have run 5 gallons of gas through it and the only problem ive had is the gaurd came off from around the trimmer attachment which i dont mind at all! plenty of power for me and the weight of it is ok as im a big guy i dont mind it always starts easy too. the blade has helped me clear about 3/4 of an acre up to small trees about 3 inches in diameter. only reason for 4 stars instead of 5 is because the gaurd isn't on it and it is supposed to not fall off<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText237879256_6g7i8hivta7vzel8q6q6kvfup_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview237879256_tzwbs8zvo84iw7csoy01cp5b9_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">+<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">2<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/838770895/review/237879256/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F838770895%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionparams=__BVSUBMISSIONPARAMETERS__&amp;submissionurl=__BVSUBMISSIONURL__&amp;user=__USERID__\" data-bvcfg=\"__CONFIGKEY__\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_AddPositiveFeedback_237879256\" href=\"javascript://\" title=\"Yes\" class=\"BVDILink BVDIValue\"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\"><span class=\"BVDINumber\">2<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVNegative BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/838770895/review/237879256/negative.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.u