opup to close it)<\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoPopupImage\"><img id=\"BVRRPhotoImage2229492\" alt=\"User submitted photo\"/><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoPopupCaption\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionThumbnail BVRRReviewPhotoThumbnail\" onclick=\"bvrrPhoto.createPhotoPopup(&quot;2229492&quot;, &quot;https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86d2FsbWFydA/eeedbdeb-c7e6-541b-a0f6-597f0dfa5ee7&quot;, &quot;BVRRDisplayContentReviewID_228387523&quot;, &quot;BVRRPhotoThumbnailImage_66jglm1068qqgxhi3ms657dke_ID&quot;, null, []);\" data-bvtrack=\"eName:Media,mediaType:Photo\"><img id=\"BVRRPhotoThumbnailImage_66jglm1068qqgxhi3ms657dke_ID\" src=\"https://photos-eu.bazaarvoice.com/photo/2/cGhvdG86d2FsbWFydA/770d78b9-9889-5019-8d29-f3b53ff45c06\" alt=\"User submitted photo\"/><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRPhotoSectionSeparator BVRRPhotoSectionSeparatorBottom\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"BVRRSeparator BVRRSeparatorReviewPhotosBottom\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"1 out of 5\" title=\"1 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" style=\"margin-left:-60px\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">1<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Zero stars. Fell apart after 3 uses.<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">05/03/2020<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2020-05-03\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReview228387523_e06tqt3tuz2g360136jqosgje_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Awful. Assembly manual is inadequate. Insides fall out when changing attachments and then won't go back together. Although Walmart returns are simple, save your time and aggravation.<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVNegative BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">-<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">3<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/838770895/review/228387523/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&